(7294164, 1137348, 18505, '<td valign="top">Beautiful!</td>', 'Beautiful!', '2014-12-19 11:18:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7294166, 1137451, 60173, '<td valign="top">A lovely woman in a classic feeling portrait. Overall it''s quite pleasant and the lighting is complimentary. <br/> <br/>I have some criticism however. It appears you took the time to not put the aged crackle effect on her face for the most part (or it''s just not appearing as strong there), but you left it on her chest. At first I thought it was hair that had been cloned out. As much as it pains me to say it, it looks like she has chest hair that''s popping out of her beautiful dress.</td>', 'A lovely woman in a classic feeling portrait. Overall it''s quite pleasant and the lighting is complimentary.  I have some criticism however. It appears you took the time to not put the aged crackle effect on her face for the most part (or it''s just not appearing as strong there), but you left it on her chest. At first I thought it was hair that had been cloned out. As much as it pains me to say it, it looks like she has chest hair that''s popping out of her beautiful dress.', '2014-12-19 11:26:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7294169, 1137356, 60173, '<td valign="top">The top half is awesome! I get a little bored toward the bottom though. I think those green lights might be pulling me out of the scene. I wish you could unplug those green lights without the threat of arrest...<br/> <br/>I do hope you post your processing steps for this.</td>', 'The top half is awesome! I get a little bored toward the bottom though. I think those green lights might be pulling me out of the scene. I wish you could unplug those green lights without the threat of arrest... I do hope you post your processing steps for this.', '2014-12-19 11:31:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(7294215, 1137208, 96751, '<td valign="top">I like the narrow band of color</td>', 'I like the narrow band of color', '2014-12-19 13:49:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7294216, 1137347, 96751, '<td valign="top">Ah, to go some day. I like the pointillist approach, but I''m not sure it enhances/transforms this image into a painting.</td>', 'Ah, to go some day. I like the pointillist approach, but I''m not sure it enhances/transforms this image into a painting.', '2014-12-19 13:50:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(7294217, 1137356, 96751, '<td valign="top">This is delightful! I feel I could look at this for ages. I just wish that neon green string of lights were more in keeping with the rest of the image. It just keeps drawing my eye away from the rest of the image</td>', 'This is delightful! I feel I could look at this for ages. I just wish that neon green string of lights were more in keeping with the rest of the image. It just keeps drawing my eye away from the rest of the image', '2014-12-19 13:52:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7294218, 1137033, 96751, '<td valign="top">Fun!!! Doesn''t look like a painting to me, but props for the technical aspect.</td>', 'Fun!!! Doesn''t look like a painting to me, but props for the technical aspect.', '2014-12-19 13:52:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(7294219, 1137245, 96751, '<td valign="top">Lovely colors, pp''g, very Renoirish, but there is something a bit weak about the composition. Perhaps it''s having her dead center. Since she''s looking behind her, perhaps she could have been placed further to the right...?</td>', 'Lovely colors, pp''g, very Renoirish, but there is something a bit weak about the composition. Perhaps it''s having her dead center. Since she''s looking behind her, perhaps she could have been placed further to the right...?', '2014-12-19 13:54:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(7294220, 1137420, 96751, '<td valign="top">This seems more like a movie still than a painting.  Very ominous!</td>', 'This seems more like a movie still than a painting.  Very ominous!', '2014-12-19 13:54:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7294222, 1137228, 96751, '<td valign="top">Everything about this image is painterly, but I find the subject oddly stiff. I like the gentle fill to show her hat on the right. I don''t know why. Expect this to finish near the top.</td>', 'Everything about this image is painterly, but I find the subject oddly stiff. I like the gentle fill to show her hat on the right. I don''t know why. Expect this to finish near the top.', '2014-12-19 13:56:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7294223, 1137357, 96751, '<td valign="top">Very painterly subject and pp''g.  Love the gentle colors.</td>', 'Very painterly subject and pp''g.  Love the gentle colors.', '2014-12-19 13:56:31.000000', NULL, 1),
