(7294547, 1137459, 170018, '<td valign="top">Love the light! The closest leaf''s shadows reminded me of a violin, so it''s also a music.</td>', 'Love the light! The closest leaf''s shadows reminded me of a violin, so it''s also a music.', '2014-12-21 00:56:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(7294549, 1137338, 170018, '<td valign="top">Mist always produces such a beautiful effect and you''ve transferred it in the painting nicely. I am pretty sure there are many people who noticed the figure in red as a perfect touch!<br/>Just out of curiosity, have you tried to go for "watercolor" effect instead of "oil painting"? Not sure it would have worked as good, just that mists are easy to paint in watercolor. :-)</td>', 'Mist always produces such a beautiful effect and you''ve transferred it in the painting nicely. I am pretty sure there are many people who noticed the figure in red as a perfect touch!Just out of curiosity, have you tried to go for "watercolor" effect instead of "oil painting"? Not sure it would have worked as good, just that mists are easy to paint in watercolor. :-)', '2014-12-21 01:05:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(7294550, 1137171, 170018, '<td valign="top">This is awesome effect! Could you please write down how did you do it? It''s perfect!</td>', 'This is awesome effect! Could you please write down how did you do it? It''s perfect!', '2014-12-21 01:07:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(7294551, 1137438, 170018, '<td valign="top">Skewsme? If not, please, take it as a compliment, it''s a poem of glassy water and soft reed and trees!</td>', 'Skewsme? If not, please, take it as a compliment, it''s a poem of glassy water and soft reed and trees!', '2014-12-21 01:13:15.000000', NULL, 1),
