(7295169, 1137258, 150277, '<td valign="top">This image felt a bit unbalanced to me, too much weight centered around the people and then all that empty space.  The composition just did not work well for me.</td>', 'This image felt a bit unbalanced to me, too much weight centered around the people and then all that empty space.  The composition just did not work well for me.', '2014-12-23 13:32:28.000000', NULL, 1),
