(7295172, 1137356, 150277, '<td valign="top">Interesting.  This image held my interest.  The more I lingered the more I enjoyed it.  I think all the red worked well, implying the holiday season quite well.  The hint of green towards the back of the path made me think there was something exciting happening further on.</td>', 'Interesting.  This image held my interest.  The more I lingered the more I enjoyed it.  I think all the red worked well, implying the holiday season quite well.  The hint of green towards the back of the path made me think there was something exciting happening further on.', '2014-12-23 13:34:04.000000', NULL, 1),
