(7295589, 1137326, 83313, '<td valign="top">Wonderful shot, I love it! Though,... I have to admit it does not have much of a painting-like appearance to me. I''m going to go out on a limb and guess that this entry is from <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=54446" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Hahn23</a> because he is A)An excellent wildlife photographer and B) Not a fan of extreme post processing.</td>', 'Wonderful shot, I love it! Though,... I have to admit it does not have much of a painting-like appearance to me. I''m going to go out on a limb and guess that this entry is from  Hahn23 because he is A)An excellent wildlife photographer and B) Not a fan of extreme post processing.', '2014-12-25 20:47:59.000000', NULL, 1),
