(7295982, 1137414, 141319, '<td valign="top">Thank you all for voting and your kind comments. It''s good to be back and do so well.  There seems to be a query on the image, as I was asked to send the original through. Hope all goes well, this is my second best score ever and it would be nice to have it on my portfolio :-). <br/>I just got reprimanded by my husband that I mislabeled the picture (not that he was there when I shot it of course ;-)). So apparently it should have been "sleeping duck eying photographer" ... I tried to explain to him that she pulled the feathers through her beak and that this was just a fraction of a second of her grooming herself, so she wasn''t sleeping, but he thinks otherwise ;-). <br/></td>', 'Thank you all for voting and your kind comments. It''s good to be back and do so well.  There seems to be a query on the image, as I was asked to send the original through. Hope all goes well, this is my second best score ever and it would be nice to have it on my portfolio :-). I just got reprimanded by my husband that I mislabeled the picture (not that he was there when I shot it of course ;-)). So apparently it should have been "sleeping duck eying photographer" ... I tried to explain to him that she pulled the feathers through her beak and that this was just a fraction of a second of her grooming herself, so she wasn''t sleeping, but he thinks otherwise ;-). ', '2014-12-27 04:39:54.000000', NULL, 0),
